# Nexus Industries Talent Strategy 2026-2030

**Document Type:** Strategic Plan
**Authority Level:** 2 (Primary)
**Last Updated:** January 2026
**Classification:** Internal

---

## Executive Summary

The Nexus Industries Talent Strategy defines our five-year roadmap to build a world-class workforce capable of delivering on our growth ambitions. Our goal is to attract, develop, and retain the best talent in our industries while building a diverse, inclusive, and engaged workforce.

